cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DIVE logbook — printable A5 scuba diving log book"
message: "If you use or adapt this logbook, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kononov
    given-names: Yury
    website: "https://ykononov.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yknnv/dive-logbook"
abstract: >-
  A printable A5 scuba diving logbook, quick reference and emergency card,
  typeset entirely in Python with reportlab. 130 pages, 42 dive record
  spreads, bilingual Russian/English field labels, single-colour print,
  punched for ring binding.
keywords:
  - scuba diving
  - dive log
  - logbook
  - printable pdf
  - typesetting
  - reportlab
